two cases and review of the literature.</article-title><source>Pediatr Surg Int.</source><year>2002</year><volume>18</volume><issue>2-3</issue><fpage>184</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s003830100672</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11956794</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="A6881R7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Abe</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kajiyama</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Harimoto</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Gion</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagaie</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Laparoscopic omentectomy for preoperative diagnosis of torsion of the greater omentum.</article-title><source>Int J Surg Case Rep.</source><year>2012</year><volume>3</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>100</fpage><lpage>2</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ijscr.2011.11.004</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">22288058</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="A6881R8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Theriot</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name><name><surname>Sayat</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Franco</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Buchino</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Childhood obesity: a risk factor for omental torsion.</article-title><source>Pediatrics.</source><year>2003</year><volume>112</volume><issue>6 Pt 1</issue><fpage>e460</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1542/peds.112.6.e460</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14654645</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="A6881R9"><label>9</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Balthazar</